# BuildKit picks this up because it sits next to the Dockerfile (the build context is the
# repos' PARENT directory, so a plain .dockerignore at the backend repo root would be
# invisible). Paths are relative to the context root, hence the **/ prefixes.
**/.git
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/uploads
**/.vite
**/TestResults
